# Integration of Bookings List Hook

## Goal
Integrate [useVendorBookings](file:///c:/Users/athar/OneDrive/Desktop/corpora-frontend/apps/vendor-frontend/hooks/use-bookings.ts#59-97) hook into [apps/vendor-frontend/app/bookings/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/athar/OneDrive/Desktop/corpora-frontend/apps/vendor-frontend/app/bookings/page.tsx) to fetch real data for Pending Requests, Upcoming Trips, and Completed Trips.

## User Review Required
> [!WARNING]
> **Missing Data in API Response**
> The provided API response structure is missing several fields required by the current UI tables:
> - **Upcoming Trips**: `driverName`, `driverVehicle`, `isLive` status.
> - **Completed Trips**: `driverName`, `driverVehicle`, `durationDistance`.
> 
> **Action**: I will use placeholder values ("N/A" or "Not Assigned") for these fields in the integration. The backend API needs to optionally include `driver` and `trip_stats` objects to fully populate these tables.

## Proposed Changes

### [apps/vendor-frontend/app/bookings/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/athar/OneDrive/Desktop/corpora-frontend/apps/vendor-frontend/app/bookings/page.tsx)
- Import [useVendorBookings](file:///c:/Users/athar/OneDrive/Desktop/corpora-frontend/apps/vendor-frontend/hooks/use-bookings.ts#59-97) from `@/hooks/use-bookings`.
- Track `page` and `pageSize` state (default 1, 10).
- Call [useVendorBookings](file:///c:/Users/athar/OneDrive/Desktop/corpora-frontend/apps/vendor-frontend/hooks/use-bookings.ts#59-97) with the current `activeTab` value.
- Map the API response `bookings` to the specific row formats required by [PendingRequestsTable](file:///c:/Users/athar/OneDrive/Desktop/corpora-frontend/apps/vendor-frontend/components/bookings/pending-requests-table.tsx#44-274), [UpcomingTripsTable](file:///c:/Users/athar/OneDrive/Desktop/corpora-frontend/apps/vendor-frontend/components/bookings/upcoming-trips-table.tsx#42-250), and [CompletedTripsTable](file:///c:/Users/athar/OneDrive/Desktop/corpora-frontend/apps/vendor-frontend/components/bookings/completed-trips-table.tsx#39-187).
- Handle `isLoading` state by showing a loader or passing it down (if tables supported it, otherwise wrap tables in loader).

### Data Mapping Strategy
| UI Column | API Field | Fallback / Logic |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Pending Requests** | | |
| Booking ID | `bookingNumber` | |
| Corporate | `corporate.name` | |
| Route | `route` | Combine `pickup` -> `drop` |
| Package | `package.name` | |
| Schedule | `schedule` | Combine `time`, [date](file:///c:/Users/athar/OneDrive/Desktop/corpora-frontend/apps/corporate-frontend/hooks/use-tags.ts#93-111) |
| Estimate Fare | `estimatedFare` | Format currency + amount |
| **Upcoming Trips** | | |
| Driver Name | **MISSING** | "Unassigned" |
| Driver Vehicle | **MISSING** | "N/A" |
| Is Live | **MISSING** | `status === 'in_progress'` |
| **Completed Trips** | | |
| Duration/Distance | **MISSING** | "N/A" |
| Driver Name | **MISSING** | "N/A" |

## Verification Plan
### Manual Verification
- Verify that switching tabs (Requests, Upcoming, Completed) triggers the API call with the correct `tab` parameter.
- Verify that data populates in the tables (even with missing driver info).
- Check that "No bookings found" or empty state is handled gracefully.
